## User

The index of the first occurrence of an element in a list, if there is one.

## Type

type
```haskell
indexOf :: Eq a => a -> [a] -> Maybe Int
```

## Term

```haskell
indexOf x xs = if x == head xs then Just $ length xs else Nothing
```

